WEBVTT

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.930
The Digital World,

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:06.030
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.450
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.260
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.010
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.640
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:54.510
The Code Crown was condensed into 
the Dark Stone by an evil power,

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:57.860
and it was used to resurrect 
the seven Death Generals.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:01.710
When DarkKnightmon tried to steal 
the souls of all the Digimon,

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.400
we fought him with all we had.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.110
With Apollomon and Olegmon's help,

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:10.360
I finally got Shoutmon's and my 
other Digimon's souls back.

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:13.640
Now it's time for the final battle.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:26.460
This is the real Great Bagra Palace.

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:28.690
No illusions anymore, right?

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.740
Yeah. There's no doubt.

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:32.700
Yuu is being held here.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.130
Yuu...

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.930
We'll rescue Yuu,

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:40.540
and we'll recover the Code Crown 
that was turned into the Dark Stone.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.750
And we'll use that power 
to create a new world.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.000
A new Digital World where Deckerdramon

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.080
and our other friends will be reborn.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:48.910
Yeah!

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.920
It's an enemy army!

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:57.390
It's most likely Bagramon's 
own imperial guard.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:00.220
Bagramon... the enemy leader, huh?

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.520
He's probably incredibly strong.

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:03.530
What should we do, Taiki?

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:07.220
It's easy to find out 
how strong the enemy is.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.950
We just have to hit him with the 
strongest power we've got.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.200
Quite a direct approach.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.440
It could work.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.540
It wouldn't be wise to throw 
any curves at this stage.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.840
Let's go! Combine all our strength!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.880
Great Xros!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:25.850
Shoutmon!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.390
MetalGreymon!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.990
Digivolve!

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.070
OmegaShoutmon!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.390
ZekeGreymon!

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:36.860
Ballistamon!

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:39.200
Dorulumon!

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:40.900
Starmons!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.320
Yes!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:44.250
Sparrowmon!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.570
Great Xros!

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:10.040
Shoutmon X7!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.810
They're here.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.920
At last, the time has come for D5.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:28.880
This is the moment when my 
long-awaited dream will come true.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:37.910
<b>The Bagra Brothers' Bond of Darkness!</b>

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.940
The Bagra Brothers' Bond of Darkness!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:48.300
Hi there, Yuu. Are you feeling better?

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.250
Taiki Kudou and his friends 
have arrived at last.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.330
It's time for the final showdown.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:59.780
Let us fight to become true game masters.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:02.180
No.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:03.680
What?

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.980
Damemon died.

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.190
He is a game piece.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.520
He can't die.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:12.910
Then bring him back to life, right now!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.110
You can't, can you?

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:19.570
This battle is no game.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:23.430
It really is just like Taiki said.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.090
I don't...

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.050
<i>Damemon!</i>

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:33.160
<i>From now on, you will fight alone.</i>

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:37.590
<i>You mustn't lose...</i>

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:42.850
I never want to feel 
that kind of pain again!

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.950
I see...

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:48.520
It appears you've learned the truth.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:51.200
This means you are no 
longer of use to me.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.720
But I still need you.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:58.800
You must supply me with 
the power to DigiXros.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:00.610
D-DarkKnightmon...

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:18.000
And here I kept up this little charade

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.290
so that you could draw out 
that power more easily.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:25.200
You should have just kept enjoying 
yourself without questioning anything.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.770
Still, you did well to hold out this long.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:29.660
Goodnight, Yuu.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:32.720
H-Help me!

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:34.840
Taiki! Sis!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:43.850
Just stay there and continue 
supplying the power to DigiXros.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:47.350
Chuchumon, don't take your eyes off him.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:51.620
I will present this to my brother.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:09.270
Here is the Dark Stone, made by 
accumulating negative power.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:12.510
Now is the time to activate it.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:16.170
So today is the day we set D5 in motion.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.520
But, my brother...

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:24.800
Yes?

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:29.160
Double Flare Buster!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.890
Would it be too late if we waited

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:34.630
until after these pests are eliminated?

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.130
That won't do.

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:38.900
They are the ones who 
need to see it most of all...

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:43.010
Your greatness, and the 
beginning of the new age.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.180
Very well.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:01.790
What's happening?

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.860
Lord Bagramon is about to emerge.

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.030
Bagramon?

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:11.930
Tremble with fear and bow 
before his greatness.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:20.910
Bagramon...

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:25.180
This one won't let us off easy, Taiki.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:27.760
I know. He's different.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:30.120
Something about him feels different

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.820
from all the other Digimon we've met.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.450
I welcome you all to 
the Great Bagra Palace.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.260
I am the leader of the New Bagra Empire,

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:44.540
Emperor Bagramon.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:45.940
Emperor?!

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:50.230
You have evaded the attacks 
of my seven Death Generals

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:54.440
as well as my younger 
brother, DarkKnightmon.

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:57.030
Truly, I commend you.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.520
Well done.

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:01.990
DarkKnightmon is your brother?!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:07.490
As a reward, we will show 
you something wonderful.

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:11.580
And what would that be? 
Your final moments?!

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.560
Stop, X7!

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:16.730
You're the one who said we should 
hit him with our strongest power!

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.240
Take some of this!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:22.240
Xros Burning Rocker!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.600
Why, you...

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:32.620
Double Flare Buster!

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:35.950
Seven Victorize!

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:42.890
How's that?

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.570
Are you satisfied now?

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:51.540
I'm not finished talking.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.830
Shoutmon! Guys!

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.480
X7 can't do a thing against him!

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:02.950
What kind of monster is he?

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:07.080
I only wanted to show you, 
whom I acknowledge

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:10.150
as worthy adversaries, 
this splendid occasion:

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:12.820
the Day of Ultimate Destruction.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:14.570
D5?

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:17.470
Oh, you've heard of it?

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.760
Then it won't take long to explain.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:22.010
The Dark Stone!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.670
I-It's in his body?

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:28.850
The five Ds of D5 stand for

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:34.240
Dimension Delete and 
Deadly Destruction Day.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:39.540
In other words, the day when dark 
power destroys all dimensions

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.890
and fuses them together.

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:43.730
Even humans will fall,

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:46.290
and all time and space will 
be under my command.

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:51.910
And you three have 
contributed a great deal.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:56.600
The fall of the seven Death 
Generals was not unexpected.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:11:00.840
In fact, their vexation 
turned into negative energy

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:05.280
that accelerated the completion 
of the Dark Stone.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:07.110
That's...

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.450
I get it!

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:16.050
The one who sent us to the 
human world was Bagramon!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:21.110
He has the power to 
influence entire realms.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.350
If that power grows even stronger...

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:27.100
That's right. I can even do this.

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:41.610
I can reach it...

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:44.050
I can grasp the human world in my hand!

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:47.420
Behold, rebellious humans.

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:50.070
Today is D5,

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:52.760
the day of your world's demise.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:54.260
No! We have to stop him!

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:55.990
Reload, Cyberdramon!

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.260
Please, don't be so crude.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:07.490
Taiki!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.310
Taiki!

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:11.620
Your ace is gone already?

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:24.760
<b>Original Digimon Contest! The Five Special Award Winners</b>

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:24.760
<b>3. The Nene and Sparrowmon Award</b>

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:24.760
<b>Satoshi Yamaguchi's Design</b>

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:24.760
<b>Soundbirdmon</b>

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.990
Don't copy me!

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:41.330
I wasn't copying you.

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.350
Taiki...

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:50.820
<i>Only Taiki Kudou may return.</i>

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:54.250
<i>If, by some miracle, you guys 
are able to come back, too...</i>

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.600
<i>then follow me.</i>

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:57.120
<i>Okay.</i>

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:11.640
<i>Akari?</i>

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:15.710
<i>Please be careful, Taiki... Shoutmon.</i>

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:17.580
<i>I'm off.</i>

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:27.650
<i>We'll find a way there to 
help you, no matter what!</i>

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.220
It sounded awesome when I said it, but...

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:35.260
How can we get back to the Digital World?

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:38.460
If we just keep sitting around, 
the battle will be over.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:42.530
Time passes more quickly 
there than it does here.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.570
That's it! In that case...

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:49.140
Koto Ward, give me power!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.540
What kind of power can it give you?!

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:55.310
Akari, please don't jab me. 
It really hurts.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:04.430
What is that?!

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:05.620
Run!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.090
It can't be...

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.980
A hand just popped out of the sky!

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:14.500
It looks like the hand that sent 
us back to the human world!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.180
What is that thing?

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:20.510
You don't think Taiki and 
the others lost, do you?!

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:23.190
It couldn't be! 
We just parted ways not long ago!

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:40.560
Everyone's turning to stone 
for no concrete reason!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.710
Can you hear me?

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:44.630
What was that voice?

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:46.450
I heard it inside my head...

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:47.800
Who are you?!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:55.070
Come quickly! Follow my voice!

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:56.670
What's that?

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:05.620
Tactimon's will has guided me.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.520
My hand will now change the human world.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:10.490
Excellent work, Brother.

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.260
T-Taiki...

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.330
Thanks, Mervamon.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:21.280
If anything happened to you,

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.300
I couldn't show my face to Beelzebumon.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:24.170
Mervamon...

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.910
We can't go up from here.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:29.310
Let's look for a place 
where we can climb up.

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:29.970
Yeah.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.910
Please hang in there, Kiriha.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:46.790
Kiriha Aonuma, 
what is that look in your eyes?

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.540
The Code Crown is not yours!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:50.760
We'll be taking it!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.580
Code Crown?

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.070
You amuse me.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:58.810
The Code Crown has already 
become the Dark Stone.

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:01.550
What do you think you can do?

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:03.890
I was the one who gave that Xros Loader

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:06.620
to you in the first place, was I not?

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:07.910
So I hear.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:10.850
That's what Gravimon said.

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:14.800
My brother had the idea to 
give humans Xros Loaders

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:18.570
to draw out the power of the DigiXros.

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:23.290
I knew I could never match 
my brother's greatness.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.630
So I tried to find my own 
way using the DigiXros.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.860
And the one he chose was Yuu Amano.

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:32.540
I was deeply impressed 
by his wonderful idea,

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:36.770
so I chose you and gave 
you a Xros Loader.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:39.520
And all this despite knowledge 
of my competitive spirit.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.910
Such a big-hearted brother.

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:44.220
Why did you choose me?

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:50.000
Because I sensed in you a 
tremendous hunger for strength.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.260
Kiriha Aonuma.

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:59.620
But you fell short of my expectations.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:00.980
You were no match for Yuu,

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:04.540
or even for Taiki, 
the one Omegamon chose.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:09.790
In other words, Kiriha, 
you are my one defeat...

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:10.440
my disgrace.

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:12.290
You're calling me a disgrace?

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:14.250
You should be proud of me!

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.100
What?

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.560
I am just what you saw in me...

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:18.900
No, I'm more!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:21.690
Bagramon, I have grown stronger,

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:22.990
along with my friends!

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:24.760
I'll make you realize that!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:28.510
Come on, ZekeGreymon! 
This is no time for lying around!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:31.890
Shoutmon, help me out, too!

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:34.730
Think of me as Taiki until he comes back!

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:39.140
You're not a replacement for Taiki.

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:40.730
You're Kiriha.

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:43.010
I'm helping you because 
you are who you are.

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:47.110
Let's go! Defeat the Emperor Bagramon!

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:50.050
Take this!

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:51.820
Hard Rock Damashi!

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.750
Zeke Flame!

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:59.190
Brother, I shall...

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.430
It's all right. I'm enjoying this.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:09.910
Wisemon...

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:11.280
What is it, Taiki?

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.640
Doesn't that look suspicious?

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.510
We're in some sort of 
energy supply facility.

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:19.400
It must have something to do with D5.

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:22.410
No, this isn't negative power.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.020
It's human Digi-power.

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.020
Human?

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:28.360
Heavy Metal Vulcan!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:30.510
Not bad.

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:34.430
Even with my right arm occupied by D5,

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:36.540
I didn't expect to be attacked so fiercely.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.100
It didn't work?

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:40.570
Don't give up!

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:41.850
Yeah! Look there!

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:45.800
He's wounded!

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.020
Even he's not perfect!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.610
He can get hurt!

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:51.770
You injured me?

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:56.160
I take back my previous 
statement, Kiriha.

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:59.250
I didn't realize you had 
gained so much power.

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:03.560
But you must not forget.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:07.820
I am now one with the Dark Stone.

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:12.180
I have merged with the power 
to create a new Digital World.

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.030
Behold!

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:18.630
If I wield all of this power,

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.910
even with only my left arm,

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.410
I can wipe out everything.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.210
<i>His strongest attack is coming!</i>

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:36.650
Feel the wrath of the Emperor!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.370
Force him back with continuous attacks!

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:42.830
Destroy Smash!

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.010
Beat Slash!

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.260
Your efforts are futile!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:57.890
Did we get him?!

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:00.350
Look out!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:02.100
It's the guard!

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.400
Leave this to me!

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:03.820
Counting on you!

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:07.690
So this is indeed an important facility.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:09.890
Maybe this is where they're keeping Yuu!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:15.090
How was that? 
Looks like it got to him a little.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.170
Wh-What is this?

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:26.700
I apologize, great Brother.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:30.440
Why, you... 
You've been waiting for this moment?

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:36.070
Yes. The moment when all of your 
power is directed toward D5

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:39.740
was my one and only 
opportunity to surpass you.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:44.880
Still, even with your fearsome 
right arm out of the picture,

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.430
your left arm has 
tremendous power, as well.

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:51.000
There was still a great 
risk of counterattack.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.160
So you used us as decoys?!

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:59.240
I wanted to make use of your 
miraculous offensive strike.

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:02.260
To create a moment when his left arm

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:05.740
would be occupied, as well.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.490
Fool.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:11.190
Do you think this degree of 
damage is enough to best me?

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:12.560
Certainly not.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.730
I came to that conclusion many years ago.

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:17.980
But have you forgotten?

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:23.350
For what purpose do you think 
I discovered the DigiXros?

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:27.430
You wouldn't!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:31.390
To absorb you, Brother.

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:37.010
Darkness Loader DigiXros!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.610
No! Stop this!

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:53.760
Bagramon is...

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:55.720
Bagramon?

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:58.400
Such a Digimon no longer exists.

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:00.730
My brother is gone.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:02.930
I have won!

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:09.690
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:13.210
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:13.210
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.780 --> 00:22:17.150
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.160
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.160
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:33.100
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:26.960
<b>Aquatic Type</b>

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:33.100
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Jet Arrow</b>

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Aquatic T</b>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.770
Whamon.

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:33.130
His huge body puts him in the 
largest class of Digimon!

00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:36.860
I bet you could build 
a house in his mouth!

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:39.010
Wha...

00:22:40.570 --> 00:22:43.540
DarkKnightmon is blocking our 
way with overwhelming power!

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:45.700
My brother's power was extraordinary,

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:49.360
but now he is no more than a part of me.

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:51.150
How can we defeat him?!

00:22:51.150 --> 00:22:52.580
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Drawing Nigh!</b>

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>The End of the Human World, D5!!</b>

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:54.450
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
